- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` used with `#if NET7_0_OR_GREATER` — optimal source-generated regex
- ✅ Fallback uses `RegexOptions.Compiled` with `static readonly` — correct for older TFMs
- ✅ `Concat(char, ReadOnlySpan<char>)` uses `stackalloc` — zero-heap helper available but underused

